  storyText: "The Offer\n\nAn Arasaka AV drops you at a facility on the Watson waterfront. A cold, polite man waits: Ishida, counter-intelligence.\n\n\"50,000 eb and Arasaka protection, in exchange for the shard. A generous offer. I suggest you take it.\"\n\n1. Accept.\n2. Negotiate.\n3. Refuse."
